+# ADR-002: Response when exhausted
+
+Status: accepted
+
+## Decision
+410 Gone
+
+## Rationale
+Same semantics as expiry, which clients already handle.
+
+## Alternatives
+- 404 (hides that the link existed)
+- Redirect to a landing page (needs product input)
